    "description": "Says the user's role on the server can't change data gateways. Shown in the outcome banner when the server refused a change to a data gateway, or to one of its language names, on the data gateway list and on a data gateway's own screen; above the submit on the add and edit form when the server refused a save; and in place of that submit when the server says the user's role can't save it. The user can still see data gateways."
  },
  "dataGatewayDismiss": "Dismiss",
